      "description": "The TOTO Museum celebrates the centennial of the renowned sanitary ware manufacturer. Located in Kitakyushu, the museum showcases the evolution of plumbing technology, innovative toilet designs, and cultural changes in Japanese bathing and hygiene.",
      "highlights": [
        "Evolution of Japanese toilets and sanitary ware",
        "Futuristic architectural design",
        "Historical artifacts from TOTO's founding"
      ],
      "openingHours": "10:00–17:00 (last admission 16:30)"
    },
    "ja": {
      "name": "TOTOミュージアム",
      "description": "TOTOミュージアムは、北九州市に位置するTOTO創立100周年記念施設です。日本の水まわり文化の変遷や、衛生陶器・ウォシュレットの技術進化を実物展示とともに学べる、世界的にも珍しい博物館です。",
      "highlights": [
        "衛生陶器と水まわり製品の歴史展示",
